>> Animal := Ihe ohuru.
Animal mgbe-ọbịara: ['sound:'] mee: { :s nke-ya sound := s. }.
Animal mgbe-ọbịara: ['makeSound'] mee: { Mpụta dee: nke-ya sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal ohuru.
Cat mgbe-ọbịara: ['init'] mee: { nke-ya sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat mgbe-ọbịara: ['meow'] mee: { onwe makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
